2. **Import the configuration in the test.** The docs suggest one `@Configuration` class per domain area, so you can enable the one you need with `@Import` [S7]. `@Import` is also the documented way to register extra components in `@WebMvcTest` [S1]:

   ```java
   @WebMvcTest(MyController.class)
   @Import(MyWebConfiguration.class)
